-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1102: values read from an imported module that are NOT
-- closed constants. Neither can be carried into the model, so each reference
-- is written as L4 text and reported Blocking.
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `export-imported-limits`

-- `default colour` reads a constructor of a type the imported module declares
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is red` IS `default colour` EQUALS red

-- an imported function
GIVEN h IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly hours at` h IS `weekly hours at` h TIMES 52 DIVIDED BY 12
